# Assessment Methodology

The assessment followed a non-intrusive, discovery-first methodology designed to avoid operational disruption.

## Techniques Used
- Physical asset walkthrough
- Workflow observation
- Identity and access review
- Internal-only network reconnaissance
- Endpoint configuration sampling
- Backup and recovery posture review
- Data handling observation

## Guiding Principles
- Do not disrupt production workflows
- Prioritize business survivability
- Reduce risk before optimizing controls
- Sequence remediation to preserve uptime
- Avoid over-hardening in an SMB context
